  <item>
    <title>E21-职场: 大厂出走, 我们自由了吗?四主播清醒聊一壶</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64be4ebeb3f6c440a8ea09f4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64be4ebeb3f6c440a8ea09f4</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 25 Jul 2023 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>俺们四人组又聚会啦，半年了，更新一下上次自由话题之后各自的状态（两位已从大厂出走），如果说上次的主题是《自由的梦醒时分》，这次的主题可以是《自由的清醒十分》？哈哈没有严格框定，主要是老友见面更新近况，唠唠嗑。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾信息：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Super黄：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>公众号：super黄的念想</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>播客：深入聊聊</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>然阿姨：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>公众号：然阿姨的产品课</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>播客：恍然大悟</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>Tiger：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>播客①：虎言乱语</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>播客②：姜虎烤肉馆</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>我的：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ncaUm2EG7qUMAgKcMG98kA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ncaUm2EG7qUMAgKcMG98kA"><strong><span>了解我的教练式咨询</span></strong></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>微信-fruitjellycc</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>公众号-向心修炼</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>感恩然阿姨的精彩剪辑⬇️</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Shownotes：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="44">00:44</a> 四人自我介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span>四人近况update：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="139">02:19</a> super黄老师：与职业培训机构合作的反思，之后的努力转型（与生财有术一些人连接和学习）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="538">08:58</a> 然阿姨：默默继续上班，继续反思警惕：不要被大厂规则驯化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="748">12:28</a> Summer老师：除了不赚钱，什么都更好了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1291">21:31</a> Tiger老师：野狗型员工的知识付费创业之路，单纯而充实</span></p><span></span><p><span>几个产品经理/运营对钱的认知的迭代：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1933">32:13</a> Super黄对钱的理解的迭代：以AIGC热潮为例</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2200">36:40</a> 信息差永恒存在</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2264">37:44</a> 信息差转化成变现机会也不那么容易</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2324">38:44</a> 找到刚需：许愿婚姻 学业 暴富</span></p><span></span><p><span>到底赚的是哪份钱？不如向“土老板们”学习</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2369">39:29</a> 思维模式和做事方法的变化：大厂理想化产品策划vs 自己干get hands dirty</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2423">40:23</a> 取决于谁给你发钱：公司打工vs自己干</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2490">41:30</a> 向“土老板”学习吧！他们才是最好的产品经理</span></p><span></span><p><span>他们如何敢于做自由职业决策？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2612">43:32</a> 被裁？冲动？主动想清楚了放弃什么？自由职业选择是价值观的试金石</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2713">45:13</a> 上班为何痛苦？因为上班不是主业！tiger说如何找到自己的“业”</span></p><span></span><p><span>自由职业的难点，不建议轻易尝试</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3003">50:03</a> 自由职业不是现在职场痛苦的救赎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3193">53:13</a> 自由职业并没有什么“商业模式”，不如让商业机会生长起来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3297">54:57</a> Super换了几次方向，希望这次是模糊的正确</span></p><span></span><p><span>现在市场上的机会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3614">60:14</a> Summer：和钱挂钩的需求 + 心理安慰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3661">61:01</a> Tiger：男女情感赛道和身心灵的课程比较火</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3728">62:08</a> 然阿姨：心理咨询培训等资格证培训需求量暴增</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3803">63:23</a> Super黄反思：专注一个方向深挖、从用户角度换位思考</span></p><span></span><p><span>展望未来半年的规划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4041">67:21</a> Super黄老师：生财有术社群学习，离钱更近</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4300">71:40</a> 然阿姨：加入母婴赛道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4359">72:39</a> Summer老师：继续做好1v1职业咨询、产品管理课程和企业内训</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4501">75:01</a> Tiger老师：继续创业，做好直播，向“土老板”学习</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>节目简介：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>人生之路，不管陷入低谷、还是站在高峰，不管走多远、走到哪，终究会走到一条自我发现、自我修炼的道路上。我是Summer，前腾讯11年产品经理，多年ToC+ToB业务和管理经验。会在这聊聊职场发展、产品成长、人生选择相关话题，不求热点、卖点，只求真诚、真心。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《Regent's Park》-Bruno Major /George Bruns</span></p>]]></description>
