    <title>E20-创业:投资人x战略分析x产品经理，聊各自经历的创业生态与个体出路</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64ad516ddc89afb6ef7270d0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64ad516ddc89afb6ef7270d0</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 13 Jul 2023 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>新开一个创业系列话题，这期是与实验品626两位优秀主播的对谈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播施言一直从事战略分析，大厂和传统公司都有经验，同时也是奇绩创坛的fellow，参与一些早期创业项目的对接工作，有多元的创业项目理解视角。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播佩佩一直从事VC工作，见过各类创业项目，思维缜密，逻辑清晰，对投资行业和创业生态变迁的理解也非常深刻。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期我们聊到了：</span></p><span></span><p><span>大厂内部和外部企业各自创新创业的趋势变迁；未来个体（创业）发展有哪些出路；产品思维与创业思维的有哪些不同；如果创业，关键点包含哪些因素；从投资人角度更看中什么；作为个体如何抓住新浪潮等等。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你对创业趋势或个体探索感兴趣，或许有你需要的，听起来吧~</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期合作电台：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61c364812d223855ed0af6a6" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61c364812d223855ed0af6a6"><span>实验品626</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>节目简介：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>人生之路，不管陷入低谷、还是站在高峰，不管走多远、走到哪，终究会走到一条自我发现、自我修炼的道路上。我是Summer，前腾讯11年产品负责人，多年ToC+ToB业务和管理经验。会在这聊聊职场发展、产品成长、人生选择相关话题，不求热点、卖点，只求真诚、真心。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>与我联系：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ncaUm2EG7qUMAgKcMG98kA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ncaUm2EG7qUMAgKcMG98kA"><strong><span>了解我的教练式咨询</span></strong></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>微信-fruitjellycc</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>公众号-向心修炼</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>即刻-Summer喵老师</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>Shownotes：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">01:45</a> &nbsp;嘉宾介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="190">03:10</a> &nbsp;大厂内部看创新创业机制和变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="640">10:40</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;从投资人视角看社会上创新创业的趋势演进</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1662">27:42</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;AI是未来组织和个体的新选择吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1899">31:39</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;探讨AI的学习门槛以及如何应对</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2139">35:39</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;大厂人看到的个体新出路选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2301">38:21</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;投资人看到的个体新出路选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2555">42:35</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;战略分析师看到的个体新出路选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2796">46:36</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;不确定性的个人创业不一定是坏事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2924">48:44</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;“每隔10年就有一个行业神话破灭”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3147">52:27</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;从资深打工人到个体创业者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3445">57:25</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;任何时候主动背后才是选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3499">58:19</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;投资人看创业者的黄金要点信息</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3926">65:26</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;最难最极端的时候更能见真章</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4172">69:32</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;创业者思维框架对个体人生也适用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4393">73:13</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;每个人来点小建议</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Beautiful Day 》-萨吉</span></p>]]></description>
